---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Terms for using Inferno Tips, its practice drills, optional accounts, and public leaderboards."
    />
    <title>Terms of Service — Inferno Tips</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="credits-page">
      <a href="/">← Back to Inferno Tips</a>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p>
        Last updated: <time datetime="2026-09-21">21 September 2026</time>
      </p>
      <p>
        Inferno Tips is a free, independent fan project operated by Oliver
        Atkinson. These terms apply to the website, practice drills, optional
        accounts and public leaderboards. By using the service, you agree to
        these terms. Contact{' '}
        <a href="mailto:tos@inferno.tips">tos@inferno.tips</a> with questions or
        concerns.
      </p>
      <h2>Using the practice tools</h2>
      <p>
        The drills simulate selected Old School RuneScape mechanics. They are
        learning aids and may contain mistakes or differ from the live game. A
        score or completed lesson does not guarantee success in the Inferno. You
        do not need to provide a RuneScape login, password or game account
        access to use this site.
      </p>
      <h2>Accounts and eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        You can practise without signing in. Where account sign-in is available,
        Discord identifies your account so you can save results across devices.
        You must meet Discord’s minimum age and eligibility requirements to use
        Discord sign-in. Keep your Discord account secure and only sign in to
        accounts you are authorised to use.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can stop using the site at any time. Account settings provide
        export, sign-out and deletion controls. The{' '}
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains what we collect and how
        to request access, correction or deletion.
      </p>
      <h2>Fair use and public scores</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Do not submit fabricated scores, automate ranked play, or bypass score
          validation or request limits.
        </li>
        <li>
          Do not try to access another person’s account or private data, or
          disrupt the service.
        </li>
        <li>
          Use public names that do not impersonate others, reveal someone’s
          private information, or contain abusive, hateful or unlawful content.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Publishing a score makes your chosen display name and result visible to
        other visitors. You give us permission to display that name and result
        as part of the leaderboard. Browser imports are personal history and do
        not qualify as verified account passes or public scores.
      </p>
      <p>
        We may hide invalid or abusive entries, restrict access for misuse, or
        correct results affected by bugs. Contact us if you believe a
        restriction or score removal was a mistake.
      </p>
      <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to keep the tools useful, but cannot promise uninterrupted
        access, error-free simulations or permanent storage. Features and
        scoring rules may change. Keep your own export of results that matter to
        you. To the extent permitted by law, the service is provided as
        available, without guarantees about its suitability for a particular
        purpose. Nothing in these terms excludes liability or limits rights that
        cannot lawfully be excluded or limited.
      </p>
      <h2>Game assets and other services</h2>
      <p>
        Inferno Tips is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by Jagex
        or Discord. RuneScape, Old School RuneScape and game artwork belong to
        Jagex Ltd. Other materials remain subject to their owners’ rights and
        licences; see <a href="/credits/">Credits & sources</a>. These terms do
        not grant ownership of third-party assets.
      </p>
      <p>
        External tools, videos and sign-in providers have their own terms and
        privacy policies. We do not control those services.
      </p>
      <h2>Updates and contact</h2>
      <p>
        Changes to these terms will be published here with an updated date.
        Material changes will also be called out on the site. For support,
        complaints, or privacy requests, email{' '}
        <a href="mailto:tos@inferno.tips">tos@inferno.tips</a>.
      </p>
      <nav aria-label="Policy pages">
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> ·{' '}
        <a href="/credits/">Credits & sources</a>
      </nav>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
